# A Saga's "enters with a lore counter" is an intrinsic ability's replacement effect (CR 714.3a, 614.1c), so Doubling Season
# doubles it: Song of Freyalise enters with two, and its chapters I and II both trigger (CR 714.2b). The lore counter its
# controller puts on it as their precombat main phase begins is a turn-based action (CR 714.3c, 703.4f), no effect, so it is one:
# three, not four. Chapter III's "put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control" is an effect's, doubled: Ornithopter gets two.

